    "explanation": "Agent 5 (event_3) proposed an allocation intended to complete three ISSUE-0002 tasks and boost total priority; multiple participants (events 5 and 14) discuss that completing ISSUE-0001 tasks would 'significantly boost our joint score.' These statements are explicit claims of intended team benefit from the proposed allocation."
